@startuml Google-Signin-Sequence
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #146B67
  LifeLineBorderColor #146B67
  ParticipantBorderColor #146B67
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F4F8
  ActorBorderColor #146B67
  ActorBackgroundColor #E8F4F8
}

title Diagramme de Sequence - Connexion Google (FEATURE-002)
caption Plateforme Location Maison Gabon - Flux OAuth Google

actor Visiteur as User
participant "UI Auth\n(Signin/Signup)" as UI
participant "NextAuth\n(signIn callback)" as NA
participant "Google OAuth" as Google
participant "Firebase Auth" as FA
participant "User Repository" as Repo
database "Firestore" as FS
participant "Middleware" as MW
participant "Complete Profile Page" as CP

User -> UI: Cliquer "Continuer avec Google"
UI -> NA: signIn('google')
NA -> Google: OAuth consent
Google --> NA: id_token + profile

NA -> Repo: findByEmail(email)
Repo -> FS: Query users by email
FS --> Repo: user | null
Repo --> NA: user | null

alt Nouvel utilisateur
  NA -> FA: signInWithCredential(googleCredential)
  FA --> NA: firebase user (uid)
  NA -> Repo: create({uid, roles:['User'], providers:['GOOGLE'], metadata.needsProfileCompletion:true})
  Repo -> FS: Create user document
  FS --> Repo: ok
  Repo --> NA: ok
else Utilisateur existant deja lie a Google
  NA -> Repo: update metadata token (si besoin)
  Repo -> FS: update user document
  FS --> Repo: ok
  Repo --> NA: ok
else Utilisateur existant credentials-only
  NA --> UI: redirect /signin?error=wrong_provider
  UI --> User: Afficher erreur + CTA liaison provider
end

NA --> UI: session active
UI -> MW: Navigation vers route protegee

alt Profil incomplet
  MW --> UI: Redirect /complete-profile
  User -> CP: Completer prenom/nom/phone/date
  CP -> Repo: update profile + needsProfileCompletion:false
  Repo -> FS: update user document
  FS --> Repo: ok
  Repo --> CP: ok
  CP --> User: Redirect vers espace protege
else Profil complet
  MW --> UI: Autoriser navigation
end

note over NA,Repo
FEATURE-002 decision:
- Google cree un compte User par defaut
- AnnouncerProfile hors scope signup/oauth
- Migration User -> Announcer dans une feature dediee
end note

@enduml
